{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8aaa6e51-6c2e-8d52-b989-34ad4caf32f6",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T10:21:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. Lucia Souza, I'm at 44 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill. I've got water pooling at the bottom of my driveway and I want it on somebody's list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 44 Eustis. Let me get that down. Is this from the rain that's coming down today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the rain that's hitting today. It started early this morning and by nine there was a puddle sitting right on the apron, where the driveway meets the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The apron, okay. And is the puddle staying there, or is it moving?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It moves, that's the problem. The apron dips, so it holds a good-sized puddle and then the overflow drains back toward the garage door. I put a towel along the bottom of the door, but that won't last if this keeps up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Water collecting at the apron and running toward the garage. Is there a storm drain close by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a catch basin down at the curb, about two houses over, and the grate was packed with leaves. I went out with a rake handle and my gloves and pulled them off by hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you went out in this? Did that help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For about ten minutes. It drained down nicely, and then more leaves and muck came along and it slowed right back down. So I'd say it's partly the grate and partly the way that apron is graded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Let me note that you already cleared it by hand and it only helped briefly. Is any water in the garage yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. It's at the door, not under it. I'm keeping an eye on it. Sorry, one second. [pause] I'm back. My grandchild's here doing homework at the kitchen table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She's learning cursive and she's complaining about the loops. Every lowercase L looks like a pretzel, she says. Anyway, back to the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Okay, so I've got the address, the apron puddle running toward the garage door, and the catch basin with leaves that you cleared. Anything else, like a number on the basin or a nearby pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No number that I can see. It's the one on the Eustis side, closest to the corner by my neighbor's hedge. They'll find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good enough. I'll send this over as a drainage and catch basin request. Since it's raining right now, I'll tell you plainly, crews will be busy with a lot of calls like this one. It may be a bit before somebody gets out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand that. I'm not asking for someone this minute. I just want it logged and the basin cleaned out properly once the rain's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And the apron itself, the dip in the driveway, I'll note that too so they can look at it when they're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. That part isn't new, but it's worse with a heavy rain like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I get a callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0191. That's the landline, so if I don't pick up, leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191. Got it. And you'd like a call back once the work's been done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:21:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'd like a call back when it's done. Even a message on the machine is fine, just so I know somebody was there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll put that in the notes, call back on completion."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Souza. Keep that towel handy, and stay dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:21:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
